I've made a rather neat discovery with magic markers.  Using a priest,
i rolled until I got one with a magic marker and presto, you then have
a blessed magic marker.  What good is this, you may ask.  Well, it will
write a blessed scroll, and a cursed magic marker will write cursed 
scrolls.  I'm not sure what will happen if you try to write on a cursed
scroll with a blessed marker, I'd guess that it change the scroll to 
a normal one, but that's just a guess.

